    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Day Of Survival&quot; is an exciting action survival game set in a post-apocalyptic world. In this devastated scenario, players take on the role of survivors who fight to ensure their survival in the midst of a devastated environment full of dangers. The plot unfolds in a vast territory, where resources are scarce and threats are always present, from zombies to other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of exploration, construction and combat, providing an immersive experience. Players must explore the environment in search of supplies, build shelters to protect themselves from dangers for their survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realistic graphics and immersive soundtrack help create a dark and intense atmosphere that keeps players constantly on their toes. Challenging gameplay requires careful strategy and quick decisions, making each day a continuous fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether facing hordes of enemies, exploring unexplored territories or building a secure base, &quot;The Day Of Survival&quot; offers an exciting and challenging experience for fans of survival and action games. Get ready to test your skills and resilience in a world where every day could be your last.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Day Of Survival&quot; is an exciting action survival game set in a post-apocalyptic world. In this devastated scenario, players take on the role of survivors who fight to ensure their survival in the midst of a devastated environment full of dangers. The plot unfolds in a vast territory, where resources are scarce and threats are always present, from zombies to other survivors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of exploration, construction and combat, providing an immersive experience. Players must explore the environment in search of supplies, build shelters to protect themselves from dangers for their survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The realistic graphics and immersive soundtrack help create a dark and intense atmosphere that keeps players constantly on their toes. Challenging gameplay requires careful strategy and quick decisions, making each day a continuous fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether facing hordes of enemies, exploring unexplored territories or building a secure base, &quot;The Day Of Survival&quot; offers an exciting and challenging experience for fans of survival and action games. Get ready to test your skills and resilience in a world where every day could be your last.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Day Of Survival Immerse yourself in a post-apocalyptic world where every decision is crucial. &quot;The Day Of Survival&quot; is a thrilling survival game that challenges players to explore a harsh, unforgiving landscape filled with zombies and enemy soldiers.",
